        <title type="html"><![CDATA[The Men We See]]></title>
        
        
        
        <published>2026-05-30T19:16:23+05:30</published>
        <updated>2026-05-30T19:16:23+05:30</updated>
        <id>urn:uuid:7a64148e-eefd-5aa7-a965-20344f3d9ff9</id>
        
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[<ul>
<li><span class="indent-0"></span>
 The men we see, what are they?</li>
<li><span class="indent-1"></span>
   Twisted than vines,</li>
<li><span class="indent-2"></span>
     Deeper than seas.</li>
<li><span class="indent-0"></span>
</li>
<li><span class="indent-0"></span>
 Yet our captious eyes,</li>
<li><span class="indent-1"></span>
   Eager to conclude,</li>
<li><span class="indent-2"></span>
     Always blind.</li>
</ul>]]></summary>
